{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8ea23d9533d07100","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9019-E002\n3\ttitle: Dashboard tutorial gallery and launch mechanics\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9019\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9019-E001\n11\tai_signals:\n12\t  change_specificity: 0\n13\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n14\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n15\t  existing_foundation: 1\n16\t  open_questions: 1\n17\t  external_dependency: 1\n18\t  human_process_gates: 0\n19\t  repo_access: 1\n20\t  architecture_claims: 1\n21\timplementation_type: null\n22\tinvestigation_signals: null\n23\tai_implementability: High\n24\tai_implementability_score: 6\n25\tjira_key: null\n26\tbranch: null\n27\tgated_by: null\n28\tgate_failure_impact: null\n29\t---\n30\t# Dashboard tutorial gallery and launch mechanics\n31\t\n32\t## Description\n33\t\n34\tThis epic delivers the product-code half of the tutorial gallery: a curated\n35\ttutorial gallery surface in the Dashboard from which a user can launch a\n36\ttutorial into their own project with one click — opening a workbench\n37\tpreloaded with the tutorial notebook, or importing the tutorial pipeline\n38\tinto the project. The gallery reads tutorial packages conforming to the\n39\ttutorial packaging format (metadata, pinned images, validation manifest).\n40\t\n41\t## Scope\n42\t\n43\t- Add the tutorial gallery surface to the Dashboard: a browsable, curated\n44\t  listing of tutorial packages with their metadata (title, journey,\n45\t  description).\n46\t- Implement one-click launch for notebook tutorials: launching creates a\n47\t  workbench in the user's project running the tutorial's pinned image with\n48\t  the tutorial notebook loaded.\n49\t- Implement one-click launch for pipeline tutorials: launching imports the\n50\t  tutorial's pipeline definition into the user's project.\n51\t- Consume tutorial packages in the defined packaging format so the gallery's\n52\t  tutorial set can be updated independently of Dashboard releases.\n53\t- Verify launch behavior with a format-conformant tutorial package\n54\t  (including the packaging format's worked example) end to end in a clean\n55\t  project.\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- A user can open the tutorial gallery in the Dashboard and see the curated\n60\t  tutorials with their metadata.\n61\t- Launching a notebook tutorial from the gallery opens a workbench in the\n62\t  user's project, running the tutorial's pinned image with the tutorial\n63\t  notebook loaded.\n64\t- Launching a pipeline tutorial from the gallery imports the pipeline into\n65\t  the user's project.\n66\t- The gallery's launch mechanics consume tutorial packages conforming to the\n67\t  defined packaging format: a format-conformant tutorial package (not\n68\t  hand-wired into the Dashboard) launches successfully end to end in a clean\n69\t  project.\n70\t- Launching a tutorial into a project does not affect other projects or\n71\t  other users' workbenches.\n72\t\n73\t## HLR Traceability\n74\t\n75\t- **HLR-1 (P0)** — the Dashboard has a tutorial gallery from which a user\n76\t  can launch a tutorial into their project (opening a workbench with the\n77\t  notebook, or importing the pipeline). This epic covers HLR-1 in full.\n78\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9e632fe8c4c11872","agent_id":"a8d916b83c342f671","session_id":"59336e95-0b73-4918-bc9d-0677bfcc1dda","uuid":"b6a4674e-1123-4da7-9b29-9a4c7f79fef8","timestamp":"2026-10-26T13:27:18.637Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8ea23d9533d07100","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9019 decomposition"}
